  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion, minced garlic, and grated ginger; sauté until translucent.",
    "Stir in the berbere spice mix, ground cumin, and tomato paste, cooking for two minutes.",
    "Add the diced potatoes and lentils, mixing well to coat with the spices.",
    "Pour in the vegetable broth and low-fat coconut milk, stirring to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer, cover, and cook for 25 minutes until the potatoes and lentils are tender.",
    "Stir in fresh lemon juice, season with salt to taste, and simmer uncovered for five more minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh cilantro before serving.",
    "Wrap portions of the stew in lotus leaves for an authentic presentation."
  ],
